{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20021498,"chapterID":16021498,"chapterNumber":"APP-K-21498","sectionNumber":"APPENDIX K","title":"APPENDIX K — Areas With Nursing Home Restrictions","officialText":"","previewText":"(6/6/24)\n\nAPPENDIX K: Areas With Nursing Home Restrictions\n\nThe areas shown on the maps in this APPENDIX, in addition to any portion of a zoning lot that is located within the high-risk flood zone as defined in Section 64-11 (Definitions), are subject to the restrictions set forth in Sections 22-133 and 32-133 (Use Group III – uses subject to additional conditions).\n\nThese areas include:\n\nthe following islands locate","blocks":[{"id":"zr-21498-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>(6/6/24)</span></p>","plainText":"(6/6/24)"},{"id":"zr-21498-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>APPENDIX K: Areas With Nursing Home Restrictions</span></p>","plainText":"APPENDIX K: Areas With Nursing Home Restrictions"},{"id":"zr-21498-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>The areas shown on the maps in this APPENDIX, in addition to any portion of a <strong><em>zoning lot</em></strong> that is located within the <strong><em>high-risk flood zone</em></strong> as defined in Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-vi/chapter-4#64-11\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-vi/chapter-4#64-11\"><span>64-11</span></a> (Definitions), are subject to the restrictions set forth in Sections <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-ii/chapter-2#22-133\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-ii/chapter-2#22-133\"><span>22-133</span></a> and <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-2#32-133\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-2#32-133\"><span>32-133</span></a> (Use Group III – uses subject to additional conditions).<