18;</span></p>","plainText":"portions of Brooklyn Community Districts 11, 13, 15 and 18;"},{"id":"zr-21498-block-013","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>portions of Queens Community Districts 10 and 13.</span></p>","plainText":"portions of Queens Community Districts 10 and 13."},{"id":"zr-21498-block-014","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>Portions of Community Districts located within areas with nursing home restrictions are shown on Maps 1 through 5 in this APPENDIX.</span></p>","plainText":"Portions of Community Districts located within areas with nursing home restrictions are shown on Maps 1 through 5 in this APPENDIX."},{"id":"zr-21498-block-015","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"pb_after\"><span><a href=\"../../../assets/zr-7d2f1c4c4dc427f5-Zoning-Resolutions-Appendix-K-Areas-With-Nursing-Home-Restrictions.6.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Zoning Resolutions K-Areas With Nursing Home Restrictions.6\" src=\"../../../assets/zr-7d2f1c4c4dc427f5-Zoning-Resolutions-Appendix-K-Areas-With-Nursing-Home-Restrictions.6.png\" title=\"\"></a></span></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-21498-block-016","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-21498-block-017","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>Map 1 – The Bronx, Community Districts 5 and 7</span><span>&nbsp;(5/12/21)</span></p>","plainText":"Map 1 – The Bronx, Community Districts 5 and 7 (5/12/21)"},{"id":"zr-21498-block-018","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"pb_after\"><span><a href=\"../../../assets/zr-b26c97ba310c13a9-Zoning-Resolutions-Appendix-K-Areas-With-Nursing-Home-Restrictions.7.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Zoning Resolutions K-Areas With Nursing Home Restrictions.7\" src=\"../../../assets/zr-b26c97ba310c13a9-Zoning-Resolutions-Appendix-K-Areas-With-Nursing-Home-Restrictions.7.png\" title=\"\"></a></span></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-21498-block-019","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-21498-block-020","kind":"html","h